{"seq":2,"slug":"wireless-power-transmission","title":"无线能量传输：特斯拉最执着的梦想与未竟之业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/core-contributions/wireless-and-high-frequency/wireless-power-transmission","wordCount":1763,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"无线能量传输-特斯拉最执着的梦想与未竟之业\">无线能量传输：特斯拉最执着的梦想与未竟之业</h1><p>如果说多相交流系统是特斯拉已经实现的辉煌，那么无线能量传输（wireless power transmission）就是他终生追逐却始终未能落地的梦想。从 1890 年代起，他坚信可以不用任何导线，把电能输送到地球上任意角落，让全世界的灯泡和马达都从一个中央电站取电。为此，他在科罗拉多斯普林斯和长岛沃登克里夫倾注了大量心血与资金，最终在技术与商业的双重壁垒前折戟。这段历史既展现了他超越时代的想象力，也暴露了天才在工程现实面前的局限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>特斯拉设想的无线供电，并非今天手机无线充电所用的近场感应，而是一个雄心勃勃的全球方案：把巨型特斯拉线圈接入大地，向地球这个巨大导体注入低频电流，激发出&quot;大地驻波&quot;，使地球本身成为传输介质，再在任意地点用接收装置&quot;抽取&quot;能量。他甚至认为可以利用地球与电离层之间的空腔来传播能量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;  TX[巨型发射线圈接入大地] --&gt; EARTH[地球作为导体]&#10;  EARTH --&gt; SW[激发大地驻波]&#10;  SW --&gt; ION[地球-电离层空腔传播]&#10;  ION --&gt; RX[任意地点接收装置]&#10;  RX --&gt; USE[本地用电设备]\">flowchart TB\n  TX[巨型发射线圈接入大地] --&gt; EARTH[地球作为导体]\n  EARTH --&gt; SW[激发大地驻波]\n  SW --&gt; ION[地球-电离层空腔传播]\n  ION --&gt; RX[任意地点接收装置]\n  RX --&gt; USE[本地用电设备]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案类型</th>\n<th>传输机制</th>\n<th>有效距离</th>\n<th>现实状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>特斯拉的全球大地驻波</td>\n<td>把地球当导体注入电流</td>\n<td>设想覆盖全球</td>\n<td>从未成功实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近场磁感应耦合</td>\n<td>线圈间互感</td>\n<td>厘米级</td>\n<td>今天手机充电板普遍使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谐振磁耦合</td>\n<td>调谐线圈间能量交换</td>\n<td>数十厘米到米级</td>\n<td>已商用，效率受距离限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微波/激光定向传输</td>\n<td>高频定向波束</td>\n<td>可达数公里</td>\n<td>仍处试验阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"大地驻波的设想\">大地驻波的设想</h2><p>特斯拉无线供电的理论核心，是他在科罗拉多斯普林斯观测到的&quot;大地谐振&quot;现象。1899 年，他研究闪电激发的电脉冲，声称发现这些脉冲会沿地球纵向传播到对跖点再反射回来，形成稳定的&quot;大地驻波&quot;（terrestrial standing waves）。他认为，只要发射机的频率与地球的某个固有谐振频率匹配，就能用很小的功率维持遍布全球的驻波，从而在任何地方取电。</p>\n<p>这一设想在物理上可以用谐振系统的思想来表述：地球被想象成一个具有固有频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的巨大谐振腔，发射机的任务是以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 持续&quot;激励&quot;它，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>发射</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{发射}} = f_E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">发射</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理想情况下，谐振腔的能量损耗很小，维持驻波只需补充少量能量。特斯拉正是基于这种&quot;地球低损耗谐振&quot;的乐观假设，才相信全球无线供电在能量上是可行的。然而，这一假设严重低估了真实地球介质中的能量耗散。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何在物理上难以成立\">为何在物理上难以成立</h2><p>特斯拉梦想的致命弱点，在于他低估了能量在传播过程中的扩散与耗散损耗。对于向自由空间或地表辐射的能量，功率密度随距离衰减极快。以最简单的球面扩散为例，距发射点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 处的功率密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\frac{P_t}{4\\pi r^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即功率密度与距离的平方成反比。要在很远处的接收装置上收集到可用的功率，要么发射功率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大到不切实际，要么接收天线大到无法建造。即便借助大地传导，真实地壳的电阻损耗也会把能量迅速转化为热量。这条扩散与耗散的物理屏障，是任何远距离、广播式无线供电方案至今无法逾越的根本障碍——能量不像信息，微弱的信号尚可放大恢复，而能量一旦扩散损耗就无法找回。</p>\n<h2 id=\"商业与工程的双重失败\">商业与工程的双重失败</h2><p>技术之外，资金是压垮沃登克里夫的最后一根稻草。1901 年，特斯拉在 J.P. 摩根的资助下于长岛动工建造沃登克里夫塔，意图建成一座兼具无线通信与无线供电功能的全球电站。但随着马可尼用更简单、更廉价的方案率先实现了跨大西洋无线电报，摩根逐渐失去信心并撤资。塔的建设在 1906 年前后停滞，最终于 1917 年被拆除变卖以抵债。</p>\n<p>失败的原因是多重的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>物理上，广播式无线供电的扩散损耗无法克服，方案本身缺乏现实基础</li>\n<li>经济上，巨额投入看不到回报，资本无法长期支持一个无法商业化的愿景</li>\n<li>竞争上，马可尼的无线电报抢先满足了&quot;无线通信&quot;这一可落地的市场需求</li>\n<li>战略上，特斯拉坚持把通信与供电捆绑在一座极其昂贵的塔上，放大了风险</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"现代回响-从空想到有限现实\">现代回响：从空想到有限现实</h2><p>尽管特斯拉的全球供电梦从未实现，无线能量传输本身并未消亡，而是以远比他设想保守的形式落了地。今天，基于近场磁感应和谐振磁耦合的无线充电已广泛用于手机、电动牙刷乃至部分电动汽车；这些技术在原理上与特斯拉的&quot;广播供电&quot;截然不同——它们依赖发射与接收线圈紧密耦合，作用距离从厘米到米级，效率随距离迅速下降，恰恰印证了远距离无线供电的困难。</p>\n<p>在更前沿的研究中，微波和激光定向传能正被探索用于空间太阳能电站等场景，试图用高度聚焦的定向波束绕开球面扩散损耗。这些方向与特斯拉&quot;任意取电&quot;的广播理想仍有本质区别，但它们共享着同一个最初的提问者。特斯拉的价值，或许不在于他给出的方案是否可行，而在于他比同时代人更早、更大胆地追问：能量是否也能像信息一样自由传播？这个问题至今仍在激励工程师。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>特斯拉设想用接入大地的巨型线圈激发&quot;大地驻波&quot;，把地球当导体实现全球无线供电，远不同于今天的近场充电</li>\n<li>其理论建立在&quot;地球低损耗谐振腔&quot;的乐观假设上，严重低估了真实介质的耗散</li>\n<li>致命的物理障碍是能量扩散损耗：功率密度按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = P_t/(4\\pi r^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随距离平方衰减，广播式远距离供电至今无法成立</li>\n<li>沃登克里夫因物理、经济、竞争多重因素失败，但无线充电与定向传能等现代技术延续了他最初的追问</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无线能量传输：特斯拉最执着的梦想与未竟之业","id":"无线能量传输-特斯拉最执着的梦想与未竟之业"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"大地驻波的设想","id":"大地驻波的设想"},{"level":2,"text":"为何在物理上难以成立","id":"为何在物理上难以成立"},{"level":2,"text":"商业与工程的双重失败","id":"商业与工程的双重失败"},{"level":2,"text":"现代回响：从空想到有限现实","id":"现代回响-从空想到有限现实"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特斯拉线圈：谐振升压的高频之源","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/core-contributions/wireless-and-high-frequency/tesla-coil"},"next":{"title":"无线电与远程控制：遥控技术与机器人学的先声","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/core-contributions/wireless-and-high-frequency/radio-and-remote-control"}}